          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 2 (0.25 mark).</b> Edit/replace the data of the resource. Copy the content of the <b>artTools.json</b> file (provided) into the resource. <i>Practice version: already in database.json — 8 art tools, 4 with limitedTimeDeal = 0 and 4 on sale (0.3, 0.5, 0.15, 0.2); brands KingArt / Color Splash / Edding / Arteza.</i></p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 2 (0,25 điểm).</b> Sửa/thay dữ liệu của tài nguyên: chép nội dung file <b>artTools.json</b> (được phát) vào tài nguyên. <i>Bản luyện: đã có sẵn trong database.json — 8 món, 4 món limitedTimeDeal = 0 và 4 món đang giảm giá.</i></p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><pre><code>// database.json\n{\n  \"artTools\": [\n    { \"id\": 1, \"artName\": \"sky acrylic paint set\", \"price\": 25, \"description\": \"A smooth flowing acrylic paint set of 24 colours for canvas art.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/101/400/300\", \"brand\": \"KingArt\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.3 },\n    { \"id\": 2, \"artName\": \"color splash markers\", \"price\": 40, \"description\": \"Dual tip alcohol markers, 24 vivid colours.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/102/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Color Splash\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 3, \"artName\": \"edding paint pens\", \"price\": 15, \"description\": \"Permanent paint pens for glass, metal and ceramics.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/103/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Edding\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.5 },\n    { \"id\": 4, \"artName\": \"arteza watercolor pad\", \"price\": 12, \"description\": \"Cold-press watercolour paper pad, 30 sheets, 300 gsm.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/104/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Arteza\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 5, \"artName\": \"glass chalk markers\", \"price\": 18, \"description\": \"Liquid chalk markers that wipe off windows and mirrors.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/106/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Edding\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 6, \"artName\": \"kingart brush set\", \"price\": 30, \"description\": \"Twelve synthetic brushes for acrylic and oil painting.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/107/400/300\", \"brand\": \"KingArt\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.15 },\n    { \"id\": 7, \"artName\": \"arteza gouache tubes\", \"price\": 22, \"description\": \"Opaque gouache paint, 24 tubes of 12 ml.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/108/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Arteza\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 8, \"artName\": \"splash glass paint kit\", \"price\": 35, \"description\": \"Transparent stained-glass paints with outliner.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/109/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Color Splash\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.2 }\n  ]\n}</code></pre><p>Verified (Vite + React 18 build green, Playwright 30/30 against json-server@0.17.4 on the given database.json). The data mixes not-on-sale (limitedTimeDeal 0) and on-sale items, glassSurface true/false, the 4 allowed brands and lowercase multi-word names, so every requirement of Q4–Q9 has something to show. Numeric ids keep the descending sort and the ids generated by POST consistent.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><pre><code>// database.json\n{\n  \"artTools\": [\n    { \"id\": 1, \"artName\": \"sky acrylic paint set\", \"price\": 25, \"description\": \"A smooth flowing acrylic paint set of 24 colours for canvas art.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/101/400/300\", \"brand\": \"KingArt\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.3 },\n    { \"id\": 2, \"artName\": \"color splash markers\", \"price\": 40, \"description\": \"Dual tip alcohol markers, 24 vivid colours.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/102/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Color Splash\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 3, \"artName\": \"edding paint pens\", \"price\": 15, \"description\": \"Permanent paint pens for glass, metal and ceramics.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/103/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Edding\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.5 },\n    { \"id\": 4, \"artName\": \"arteza watercolor pad\", \"price\": 12, \"description\": \"Cold-press watercolour paper pad, 30 sheets, 300 gsm.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/104/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Arteza\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 5, \"artName\": \"glass chalk markers\", \"price\": 18, \"description\": \"Liquid chalk markers that wipe off windows and mirrors.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/106/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Edding\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 6, \"artName\": \"kingart brush set\", \"price\": 30, \"description\": \"Twelve synthetic brushes for acrylic and oil painting.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/107/400/300\", \"brand\": \"KingArt\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.15 },\n    { \"id\": 7, \"artName\": \"arteza gouache tubes\", \"price\": 22, \"description\": \"Opaque gouache paint, 24 tubes of 12 ml.\", \"glassSurface\": false, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/108/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Arteza\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": 8, \"artName\": \"splash glass paint kit\", \"price\": 35, \"description\": \"Transparent stained-glass paints with outliner.\", \"glassSurface\": true, \"image\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/109/400/300\", \"brand\": \"Color Splash\", \"limitedTimeDeal\": 0.2 }\n  ]\n}</code></pre><p>Đã kiểm (build Vite + React 18 xanh, Playwright 30/30 với json-server@0.17.4 trên database.json phát kèm). Dữ liệu trộn món không giảm giá và đang giảm, glassSurface true/false, đủ 4 brand, tên viết thường nhiều từ — mọi yêu cầu C4–C9 đều có dữ liệu để hiện. id dạng số để sắp giảm dần và id do POST sinh ra nhất quán.</p></div>",
